// edges — id / bgm (id-link al / bgm), tmdb (id-link tmdb), the season cells seasons / seasonBgm (season-chain by field), the ids,
// seasons and offsets inside seasonCfg (season-chain via cfg) — and everything else passed through from the record as it is (mode,
// via, tmdbMode, alTried, at, title, seasonsFor, neg, prov, review, a cfg's src / title, a "known none" 0, fields this version does not
