// ---- 5-6 (A6) re-verification on the graph: do the item's id-link, season-chain and lock-pin edges agree? Offline (the store and the
// item only). A season with its own settings or a lock is the user's: its chain cells are not judged against the work, only its pin.
//   chain-from    a season cell's evidence says it was taken from the work entry (by.kind 'parent') of ANOTHER AniList id than the work's
//   chain-value   that cell holds another entry than the work's own
//   chain-anchor  that cell stands at another season than the work entry's own (alWorkSeason; S0 rule)
//   chain-step    a sequel cell (by.kind 'chain') was reached from another entry than the cell of the season before it
//   bgm-from      a season's Bangumi cell taken from the work's Bangumi entry (by.kind 'parent-bgm') is not the work's Bangumi entry now
//   pin-al / pin-bgm / pin-tmdb  a locked season pinned on the work entry (via 'parent' / 'show-link') whose work link changed
