//   - a work whose anchors name different entries, or whose dataset value contradicts a protected value, is contested: no evidence, no candidate.
// What it yields (the batch B shadow rules, R4 semantics): agreement -> evidence (graph mapping edge, state 'strong'); only in the dataset -> a
// candidate (review.candidates, class 'dataset'), never on a protected field / season or a locked season; disagreement -> flag (mapping edge
